cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its study modules, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Legis Lectiones"
abstract: >-
  A personal study environment designed for Law School students. It transforms
  passive reading into active recall through a dynamic, interactive platform.
  The project focuses on reinforcing legal knowledge—specifically Brazilian labor law,
  civil procedure, and legal philosophy—using varied question formats, immediate 
  feedback, and active review banks.
authors:
